Hi {Owner},

I build websites for siding contractors around {City}. {Business Name} has strong before-and-after houses on its social pages, but no site a homeowner finds when they search for siding replacement.

I built a sample first rather than ask for your time: a vinyl versus fiber cement comparison, a colour and profile picker, a page on what's behind the old siding, trim details, and an estimate form, with marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

If you want it, I move it to a domain you own and finish it for {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting and changes. If not, it comes down at the end of the month.

Worth ten minutes on the phone this week?

